MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The portable SSD and microSD card fit my existing use of laptop accessories, memory cards, and Raspberry Pi equipment because they could support file transfers, backups, and projects I already pursue.",
    "The over-ear noise-cancelling headphones offer a practical improvement for my computer listening, connecting naturally with my previous headphones and under-desk headphone holder."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The streaming sticks, smart display, and security cameras serve needs I have not shown; buying computer and desk accessories does not mean I am currently building a connected home or streaming setup.",
    "Earbuds do not offer an obvious improvement for my desk use just because I have bought headphones, and a 16TB internal enterprise drive requires a storage need and suitable hardware I have not indicated."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat an interest in electronics as a reason to suggest devices with very different purposes from my recent purchases.",
    "Some suggestions seem to assume that any audio product or larger storage device would suit me, when how I would use it matters more than the broad resemblance."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My purchases often work together around concrete tasks: Raspberry Pi projects, wired networking, desk organization, and computer maintenance. Accessories that support those tasks feel more relevant.",
    "Compatibility and form matter: a memory card needs to work with my device, a portable SSD needs a suitable connection, and headphones need to suit how I listen at my desk."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognize my computer, storage, and audio interests but stretch them into unrelated device purchases without a clear practical need."
}
